# Radiometric potassium (K) color ramp — surface concentration in % K.
# gdaldem color-relief format: <value> <r> <g> <b> [<a>]
# Sequential yellow→red (same family as the total-count ramp so the
# legend reads consistently); transparent for nodata. Stops tuned for
# the NURE Bayesian K grid's typical CONUS range (~0-4 % K — granitic /
# arkosic terranes are the high end, mafic + carbonate the low).
#
# Pair with the eU / eTh ramps via RASTER_COLOR_RAMP when tiling the
# matching element grid out of the radiometric release.

nv 0 0 0 0
 0.0 255 252 200 0
 0.3 255 252 200 170
 0.8 254 230 140 200
 1.3 254 200 90 215
 1.8 253 160 50 220
 2.5 240 110 30 225
 3.0 215 60 20 230
 4.0 150 10 30 240
